<title>POLAND: SWARZEDZ SWINGS TO LOSS IN SEPTEMBER.</title>
<headline>SWARZEDZ SWINGS TO LOSS IN SEPTEMBER.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net loss		28.50 vs   0.18 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	  28.48 vs   0.38 profit</p>
<p> Operating loss	26.36 vs   1.63 profit</p>
<p> Sales		    9.69 vs   9.19</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net loss		34.07 vs   0.89 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	  33.96 vs   2.30 profit</p>
<p> Operating loss	23.64 vs   9.22 profit</p>
<p> Sales		   75.70 vs  72.03</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish furniture maker is Swarzedzkie</p>
<p>Fabryki Mebli SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
